   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3 class=\"recname\"><span class=\"kind\">function</span> ThrowAsException <span class=\"sws\"><a href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_00154\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_00154]</a></span> <span class=\"ups\">Upstream: <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf#nameddest=RS_AP_00130\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_RS_General.pdf)\">RS_AP_00130</a></span></h3>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">virtual void ThrowAsException (const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_ErrorCode_538b08.html\">ErrorCode</a> &amp;errorCode) const noexcept(false)=0;</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>Throw the given errorCode as an <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"cl_ara_core_Exception_a2d771.html\">ara::core::Exception</a>.</p><p>This function will determine the appropriate exception type for the given ErrorCode according to <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10953\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10953]</a> and throw it. The thrown exception will contain the given ErrorCode.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
