  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h4>Exceptions</h4>",
   "tail": ""
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<p>Any exception of the type as defined in <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10953\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10953]</a> containing the given ErrorCode</p>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"notes\"><b>Hinweise:</b> This function shall not participate in overload resolution when C++ exceptions are disabled in the compiler toolchain. As per <a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf#nameddest=SWS_CORE_10304\" title=\"Spezifikations-PDF (AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_Core.pdf)\">[SWS_CORE_10304]</a>.</div>",
